## R Reference

| Operator / Function | Purpose                             |
|---------------------|-------------------------------------|
| `>`                 | Greater than                        |
| `<`                 | Less than                           |
| `>=`                | Greater than or equal to            |
| `<=`                | Less than or equal to               |
| `==`                | Equal to                            |
| `!=`                | Not equal to                        |
| `sum(x)`            | Add values; can count `TRUE` values |
| `&`                 | AND                                 |
| `|`                 | OR                                  |

| Syntax         | Purpose                                   |
|----------------|-------------------------------------------|
| `x > value`    | Compare every value in a vector           |
| `x[condition]` | Keep values where the condition is `TRUE` |
